#: ../../source/blog/native_ffa.md:10
msgid "Flex-Flash-Attention: The Native Attention Kernel of MagiAttention"
msgstr "Flex-Flash-Attention：MagiAttention 的原生注意力 Kernel"

#: ../../source/blog/native_ffa.md:12
msgid "Introduction"
msgstr "引言"

#: ../../source/blog/native_ffa.md:14
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"`Flex-Flash-Attention` (`FFA`) is the attention kernel underneath "
"`MagiAttention` {cite}`magiattention2025_native_ffa`. It keeps the IO-"
"aware tiling and online softmax of `Flash-Attention` "
"{cite}`dao2022flashattention_native_ffa,dao2023flashattention_native_ffa,shah2024flashattention3fastaccurateattention_native_ffa`,"
" but replaces the batch/varlen abstraction with the [AttnSlice "
"Representation](./magi_attn.md#attnslice-representation): an attention "
"mask is an arbitrary list of `(QRange, KRange, MaskType)` rectangles that"
" may overlap along both the query and the key dimensions. This is what "
"makes the kernel *distributable*: after the dispatch solver and attn "
"solver shard the global mask across context-parallel (CP) ranks, every "
"rank and every overlap stage receives a plain list of slices, and `FFA` "
"computes it without re-encoding."
msgstr ""
"`Flex-Flash-Attention`（`FFA`）是 `MagiAttention` "
"{cite}`magiattention2025_native_ffa` 底层的注意力 kernel。它保留了 `Flash-Attention`"
" "
"{cite}`dao2022flashattention_native_ffa,dao2023flashattention_native_ffa,shah2024flashattention3fastaccurateattention_native_ffa`"
" 的 IO 感知分块与 online softmax，但用 [AttnSlice Representation](./magi_attn.md"
"#attnslice-representation) 取代了 batch/varlen 抽象：一个注意力 mask 被表示为任意多个 "
"`(QRange, KRange, MaskType)` 矩形组成的列表，这些矩形在 query 和 key 两个维度上都允许重叠。正是这一点让 "
"kernel 天然 *可分布*：dispatch solver 与 attn solver 把全局 mask 切分到各个 context-"
"parallel（CP）rank 之后，每个 rank 的每个 overlap stage 拿到的都只是一份普通的 slice 列表，`FFA` "
"无需任何重编码即可直接计算。"

#: ../../source/blog/native_ffa.md:16
msgid ""
"This post is the entry point for everything about the native `FFA` "
"kernel. We first describe the design shared by all architectures (the "
"slice IR, the scheduling model, and how partial results from overlapping "
"slices are reduced), then go through the Hopper (SM90) and Blackwell "
"(SM100) implementations and where they differ, and finally list the "
"features built on top of the kernel together with the dedicated posts "
"that cover each of them."
msgstr ""
"本文是原生 `FFA` kernel 的总览入口。我们首先介绍与架构无关的公共设计（slice IR、调度模型，以及重叠 slice "
"的部分结果如何归约），然后分别讲解 Hopper（SM90）与 Blackwell（SM100）上的实现及其差异，最后列出基于该 kernel "
"构建的各项特性，并给出每项特性对应的专题文章。"

