msgid ""
"`FFA_FA4` is **not** the native `FFA` kernel and is **not** the default "
"backend. It converts `AttnSlice` into an `HSTU Function` representation "
"and runs a forked `Flash-Attention 4` kernel, as a stopgap that brought "
"`MagiAttention` to Blackwell before the native SM100 kernel existed. See "
"the separate [blog post](./blackwell_ffa_fa4.md) for details. The rest of"
" this post only covers the two native implementations."
msgstr ""
"`FFA_FA4` **不是** 原生 `FFA` kernel，也 **不是** 默认 backend。它把 `AttnSlice` 转换为 "
"`HSTU Function` 表示，再调用 fork 出来的 `Flash-Attention 4` kernel，是在原生 SM100 "
"kernel 出现之前让 `MagiAttention` 能跑在 Blackwell 上的过渡方案。详见单独的 "
"[博客](./blackwell_ffa_fa4.md)。本文其余部分只讨论两套原生实现。"

#: ../../source/blog/native_ffa.md:31
msgid "Design Overview"
msgstr "设计概览"

#: ../../source/blog/native_ffa.md:33
msgid "AttnSlice as the Kernel IR"
msgstr "以 AttnSlice 作为 Kernel IR"

#: ../../source/blog/native_ffa.md:35
msgid "The kernel consumes three tensors:"
msgstr "kernel 接收三个张量："

#: ../../source/blog/native_ffa.md:37
msgid ""
"`q_ranges`: `int32[R, 2]`, the `[start, end)` query token range of each "
"slice over the packed `(total_q, num_heads_q, head_dim)` layout."
msgstr ""
"`q_ranges`：`int32[R, 2]`，每个 slice 在 packed 布局 `(total_q, num_heads_q, "
"head_dim)` 上的 query token 区间 `[start, end)`。"

#: ../../source/blog/native_ffa.md:38
msgid ""
"`k_ranges`: `int32[R, 2]`, the key token range of each slice over the "
"packed `(total_k, num_heads_kv, head_dim)` layout."
msgstr ""
"`k_ranges`：`int32[R, 2]`，每个 slice 在 packed 布局 `(total_k, num_heads_kv, "
"head_dim)` 上的 key token 区间。"

#: ../../source/blog/native_ffa.md:39
msgid ""
"`attn_type_map`: `int32[R]`, the mask type of each slice: `0 = FULL`, `1 "
"= CAUSAL`, `2 = INV_CAUSAL`, `3 = BI_CAUSAL`."
msgstr ""
"`attn_type_map`：`int32[R]`，每个 slice 的 mask 类型：`0 = FULL`、`1 = CAUSAL`、`2 "
"= INV_CAUSAL`、`3 = BI_CAUSAL`。"

#: ../../source/blog/native_ffa.md:41
msgid ""
"`CAUSAL` is aligned to the bottom-right corner of the slice, `INV_CAUSAL`"
" to the top-left corner, and `BI_CAUSAL` is the intersection of the two "
"(see [Basic Mask Types in AttnSlice](./magi_attn.md#basic-mask-types-in-"
"attnslice) for figures). With these four types, sliding-window and block-"
"causal patterns stay compact instead of degrading to one slice per row."
msgstr ""
"`CAUSAL` 对齐到 slice 的右下角，`INV_CAUSAL` 对齐到左上角，`BI_CAUSAL` 是两者的交集（图示见 [Basic"
" Mask Types in AttnSlice](./magi_attn.md#basic-mask-types-in-"
"attnslice)）。有了这四种类型，sliding-window 与 block-causal 等模式都能保持紧凑的表示，而不必退化成每行一个"
" slice。"

#: ../../source/blog/native_ffa.md:43
msgid ""
"Slices are not required to be sorted, disjoint, or aligned to tile "
"boundaries. Several slices may share query rows (for example, a query "
"chunk attending to several remote KV chunks in one CP stage) or share key"
" rows (several query chunks attending to the same KV chunk). Handling "
"those overlaps efficiently and correctly is the main difference between "
"`FFA` and a varlen `Flash-Attention` kernel, and it shows up in three "
"places: tile-range computation, work scheduling, and output reduction."
msgstr ""
"slice 不要求有序、不相交，也不要求与 tile 边界对齐。多个 slice 可以共享 query 行（例如某个 CP stage 中一个 "
"query chunk 同时 attend 多个远端 KV chunk），也可以共享 key 行（多个 query chunk attend "
"同一个 KV chunk）。高效且正确地处理这些重叠，是 `FFA` 与 varlen `Flash-Attention` kernel "
"的核心区别，它体现在三个地方：tile 范围计算、任务调度以及输出归约。"

#: ../../source/blog/native_ffa.md:45
msgid "AttnSlice Formulation"
msgstr "AttnSlice 表示"

#: ../../source/blog/native_ffa.md:51
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"An irregular mask decomposed into {math}`\\mathrm{AttnSlice}` units. Each"
" unit is one `(QRange, KRange, MaskType)` triplet consumed directly by "
"the `FFA` kernel."
msgstr ""
"一个不规则 mask 被分解为若干 {math}`\\mathrm{AttnSlice}` 单元，每个单元都是一个 `(QRange, "
"KRange, MaskType)` 三元组，由 `FFA` kernel 直接消费。"

#: ../../source/blog/native_ffa.md:54
msgid "Tile Range per Slice"
msgstr "每个 Slice 的 Tile 范围"

#: ../../source/blog/native_ffa.md:56
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"A forward work tile is `(slice, m_block, head)`. For slice {math}`b` with"
" query length {math}`s_q`, key length {math}`s_k` and the rows "
"{math}`[m_{min}, m_{max}]` of the current `m_block` (relative to the "
"slice), the visible key-block range is:"
msgstr ""
"前向的一个 work tile 是 `(slice, m_block, head)`。对于 query 长度为 {math}`s_q`、key "
"长度为 {math}`s_k` 的 slice {math}`b`，记当前 `m_block` 覆盖的行（相对 slice 起点）为 "
"{math}`[m_{min}, m_{max}]`，则可见的 key block 范围为："

#: ../../source/blog/native_ffa.md:58
msgid ""
"\\begin{aligned}\n"
"n_{max} &= \\begin{cases}\n"
"\\left\\lceil \\dfrac{m_{max} + 1 + s_k - s_q}{B_N} \\right\\rceil & "
"\\texttt{CAUSAL},\\ \\texttt{BI-CAUSAL} \\\\[2mm]\n"
"\\left\\lceil \\dfrac{s_k}{B_N} \\right\\rceil & \\texttt{FULL},\\ "
"\\texttt{INV-CAUSAL}\n"
"\\end{cases} \\\\\n"
"n_{min} &= \\begin{cases}\n"
"\\left\\lfloor \\dfrac{m_{min}}{B_N} \\right\\rfloor & \\texttt{INV-"
"CAUSAL},\\ \\texttt{BI-CAUSAL} \\\\[2mm]\n"
"0 & \\texttt{FULL},\\ \\texttt{CAUSAL}\n"
"\\end{cases}\n"
"\\end{aligned}"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/blog/native_ffa.md:71
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"with both bounds clamped to the slice. Inside {math}`[n_{min}, n_{max})`,"
" only the blocks that intersect a diagonal need element-wise masking; the"
" interior blocks run the unmasked fast path. Both implementations "
"specialize the three regions (causal boundary, unmasked interior, "
"inverse-causal boundary) at compile time, so the common unmasked "
"iterations carry no mask instructions and no `-inf` row checks. The "
"backward pass uses the dual formula to compute the `m_block` range of "
"each `n_block`."
msgstr ""
"两个边界都会被截断到 slice 之内。在 {math}`[n_{min}, n_{max})` 中，只有与对角线相交的 block 需要逐元素 "
"mask，内部 block 走无 mask 的快速路径。两套实现都在编译期把这三个区域（causal 边界、无 mask 内部、inverse-"
"causal 边界）特化开，因此占多数的无 mask 迭代既没有 mask 指令，也没有 `-inf` 行检查。反向用对偶的公式为每个 "
"`n_block` 计算 `m_block` 范围。"

#: ../../source/blog/native_ffa.md:73
msgid "Slice-Level Parallelism and Scheduling"
msgstr "Slice 级并行与调度"

#: ../../source/blog/native_ffa.md:75
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Each slice is treated like one sequence of a varlen batch, so the tile "
"space is the concatenation of every slice's `m_block` tiles over all "
"heads. Because slice sizes are arbitrary, a static one-tile-per-CTA grid "
"can leave SMs idle at the tail, and a short slice next to a long one "
"causes imbalance. `FFA` therefore uses **persistent CTAs with dynamic "
"tile fetching**: the grid is sized to the number of available SMs, and a "
"CTA grabs its next tile from a global atomic counter, decodes it into "
"`(slice, m_block, head)` with a warp-level prefix sum over slice tile "
"counts, and hands it to its consumer warps through shared memory. When "
"the caller provides `max_seqlen_q` (an upper bound on the longest query "
"range), the decode degrades to an {math}`O(1)` division."
msgstr ""
"每个 slice 都被当作 varlen batch 中的一条序列，因此 tile 空间是所有 slice 在所有 head 上的 "
"`m_block` tile 拼接而成。由于 slice 大小任意，静态的「每个 CTA 一个 tile」网格容易在尾部让 SM 空闲，长短 "
"slice 相邻时也会负载不均。因此 `FFA` 采用 **持久化 CTA + 动态取 tile**：网格大小等于可用 SM 数，CTA "
"通过全局原子计数器领取下一个 tile，用 warp 级前缀和在各 slice 的 tile 数上解码出 `(slice, m_block, "
"head)`，再经 shared memory 交给 consumer warp。如果调用方提供了 `max_seqlen_q`（最长 query"
" 区间的上界），解码可以退化为一次 {math}`O(1)` 除法。"

#: ../../source/blog/native_ffa.md:77
msgid ""
"The persistent grid is also how `FFA` cooperates with communication. "
"`sm_margin` reserves SMs that the attention kernel will never occupy, so "
"that the `GroupCast` and `GroupReduce` kernels of the next overlap stage "
"can start immediately instead of queueing behind attention CTAs. See the "
"[kernel overlap](./kernel_overlap.md) post for how `MagiAttention` uses "
"this."
msgstr ""
"持久化网格也是 `FFA` 与通信协作的方式。`sm_margin` 会预留出 attention kernel 永远不会占用的 SM，让下一个 "
"overlap stage 的 `GroupCast` 与 `GroupReduce` kernel 可以立即启动，而不必排在 attention"
" CTA 之后。`MagiAttention` 如何利用这一点，请参见 [kernel overlap](./kernel_overlap.md)"
" 一文。"

#: ../../source/blog/native_ffa.md:79
msgid "Reducing Partial Results Across Slices"
msgstr "跨 Slice 的部分结果归约"

#: ../../source/blog/native_ffa.md:81
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"When several slices write the same output rows, each of them produces a "
"partial output with its own log-sum-exp. Two partial results {math}`(O_1,"
" \\mathrm{lse}_1)` and {math}`(O_2, \\mathrm{lse}_2)` for the same query "
"row combine exactly as"
msgstr ""
"当多个 slice 写同一批输出行时，每个 slice 都会产生一份带有自身 log-sum-exp 的部分输出。同一 query "
"行上的两份部分结果 {math}`(O_1, \\mathrm{lse}_1)` 与 {math}`(O_2, \\mathrm{lse}_2)`"
" 可以按下式精确合并："

#: ../../source/blog/native_ffa.md:83
msgid ""
"\\mathrm{lse} = \\log\\left(e^{\\mathrm{lse}_1} + "
"e^{\\mathrm{lse}_2}\\right), \\qquad\n"
"O = e^{\\mathrm{lse}_1 - \\mathrm{lse}}\\, O_1 + e^{\\mathrm{lse}_2 - "
"\\mathrm{lse}}\\, O_2"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/blog/native_ffa.md:88
msgid ""
"which is the same correction the distributed layer applies between CP "
"stages. Since the merge is not a plain sum, it cannot be done with "
"hardware atomic adds. `FFA` supports three reduction regimes, chosen per "
"call:"
msgstr ""
"这与分布式层在 CP stage 之间所做的修正完全相同。由于这种合并不是简单求和，无法用硬件原子加完成。`FFA` "
"支持三种归约模式，每次调用时选择："

#: ../../source/blog/native_ffa.md:90
msgid ""
"**Locked LSE-weighted merge** (default, called \"atomic reduction\" in "
"the API). The output buffer in global memory is itself the accumulator, "
"kept in `float32` by default, and `lse` is initialized to `-inf`. In the "
"epilogue, a CTA acquires a spin lock per `(q_block, head)` with "
"`atomicCAS`; because a slice's query start is generally not aligned to "
"`B_M`, a tile can straddle two physical blocks and needs both locks. "
"Under the lock it reads the previous `lse`, computes the merged `lse`, "
"rescales and adds the previous `O`, writes both back, issues a memory "
"fence, and releases. A forward postprocess kernel then zero-fills rows "
"that no slice covered (their `lse` is still `-inf`), folds in attention "
"sink if present, and casts `O` to the requested dtype."
msgstr ""
"**加锁的 LSE 加权合并**（默认，API 中称为「atomic reduction」）。global memory "
"中的输出缓冲本身就是累加器，默认为 `float32`，`lse` 初始化为 `-inf`。在 epilogue 中，CTA 用 "
"`atomicCAS` 为每个 `(q_block, head)` 获取一把自旋锁；由于 slice 的 query 起点通常不与 `B_M` "
"对齐，一个 tile 可能横跨两个物理 block，需要同时持有两把锁。持锁期间，它读出之前的 `lse`，计算合并后的 `lse`，把之前的 "
"`O` 重缩放后与当前结果相加，二者写回后执行 memory fence 并释放锁。随后由前向 postprocess kernel 把没有任何 "
"slice 覆盖的行（其 `lse` 仍为 `-inf`）清零，若有 attention sink 则将其合并进来，并把 `O` 转换为目标 "
"dtype。"

#: ../../source/blog/native_ffa.md:91
msgid ""
"**Direct store**. With `disable_fwd_atomic_reduction=True` (or "
"`disable_bwd_dkv_atomic_reduction=True` in the backward pass), the caller"
" guarantees that the relevant ranges are sorted and pairwise disjoint. "
"Every output row then has a single writer, so the kernel stores results "
"in the native dtype without locks, and uncovered rows are filled by the "
"pre/post-processing kernels."
msgstr ""
"**直接写回**。设置 `disable_fwd_atomic_reduction=True`（反向对应 "
"`disable_bwd_dkv_atomic_reduction=True`）时，调用方保证相关区间有序且两两不相交。此时每个输出行只有一个写者，kernel"
" 无需加锁即可以原生 dtype 直接写回，未被覆盖的行由前/后处理 kernel 填充。"

#: ../../source/blog/native_ffa.md:92
msgid ""
"**Range merge**. Slices that share the same `q_range` (forward) or "
"`k_range` (backward) are grouped on the host into a CSR structure: sort "
"by range, collapse consecutive duplicates, and record each group's slice "
"offsets. One work tile then walks the key ranges of all slices in its "
"group inside a single online-softmax loop, so the accumulator never "
"leaves the chip and no global reduction is needed for that group. This is"
" controlled by `range_merge` at the kernel level and by "
"`MAGI_ATTENTION_RANGE_MERGE` in `MagiAttention` (experimental)."
msgstr ""
"**Range merge**。在 host 端，把 `q_range`（前向）或 `k_range`（反向）完全相同的 slice 分组为 "
"CSR 结构：按区间排序、合并连续的重复项，并记录每组的 slice 偏移。之后一个 work tile 在单个 online softmax "
"循环中遍历组内所有 slice 的 key 区间，累加器始终留在片上，这一组也就不需要任何全局归约。kernel 层通过 "
"`range_merge` 控制，`MagiAttention` 中通过 `MAGI_ATTENTION_RANGE_MERGE` "
"控制（实验特性）。"

#: ../../source/blog/native_ffa.md:94
msgid ""
"The backward pass has the same problem along both dimensions. Here the "
"reductions are plain sums, so they map to hardware: the gradient of the "
"inner loop dimension (`dQ` when the outer loop is over K/V) is "
"accumulated into a `float32` buffer with TMA bulk reduce-add, and the "
"gradient of the outer dimension (`dK`, `dV`) uses reduce-add only when "
"slices share key rows or when GQA folds several query heads onto one KV "
"head. Otherwise it is stored directly."
msgstr ""
"反向在两个维度上都面临同样的问题，但这里的归约是普通求和，可以映射到硬件：内层循环维度的梯度（外层循环为 K/V 时即 `dQ`）通过 TMA "
"bulk reduce-add 累加到 `float32` 缓冲；外层维度的梯度（`dK`、`dV`）只有在多个 slice 共享 key 行、或"
" GQA 把多个 query head 折叠到同一个 KV head 时才使用 reduce-add，否则直接写回。"

#: ../../source/blog/native_ffa.md:96
msgid "FFA Slice Atomic Reduction"
msgstr "FFA Slice 原子归约"

#: ../../source/blog/native_ffa.md:102
msgid ""
"Data loading, on-chip computation, and cross-slice reduction in the `FFA`"
" forward and backward kernels."
msgstr "`FFA` 前向与反向 kernel 中的数据加载、片上计算与跨 slice 归约。"

#: ../../source/blog/native_ffa.md:105
msgid "Pre- and Post-Processing Kernels"
msgstr "前处理与后处理 Kernel"

#: ../../source/blog/native_ffa.md:107
msgid ""
"Around the main kernels sit three small kernels, which are also the hooks"
" where several features are implemented without touching the mainloop:"
msgstr "主 kernel 周围有三个小 kernel，它们也是多项特性在不改动主循环的前提下得以实现的切入点："

#: ../../source/blog/native_ffa.md:109
msgid ""
"**Forward postprocess**: zero-fills uncovered rows, merges the attention-"
"sink LSE into `lse` and rescales `O`, and casts the `float32` "
"accumulator."
msgstr ""
"**前向 postprocess**：将未覆盖的行清零，把 attention sink 的 LSE 合并进 `lse` 并重缩放 `O`，再转换"
" `float32` 累加器的 dtype。"

#: ../../source/blog/native_ffa.md:110
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"**Backward preprocess**: computes {math}`\\Delta = \\mathrm{rowsum}(O "
"\\circ dO)` (named `dPsum` in the code), converts `lse` to the "
"{math}`\\log_2` domain used by `exp2`, and computes the sink gradient "
"`dsink` on SM90."
msgstr ""
"**反向 preprocess**：计算 {math}`\\Delta = \\mathrm{rowsum}(O \\circ "
"dO)`（代码中称为 `dPsum`），把 `lse` 转换到 `exp2` 所用的 {math}`\\log_2` 域，并在 SM90 上计算 "
"sink 的梯度 `dsink`。"

#: ../../source/blog/native_ffa.md:111
msgid ""
"**Backward postprocess**: applies `softmax_scale` to the accumulated "
"gradients, casts them, and zero-fills key rows that no slice covered."
msgstr ""
"**反向 postprocess**：对累加得到的梯度乘以 `softmax_scale` 并转换 dtype，同时把没有任何 slice 覆盖的"
" key 行清零。"

#: ../../source/blog/native_ffa.md:113
msgid "Deterministic Mode"
msgstr "确定性模式"

#: ../../source/blog/native_ffa.md:115
msgid ""
"The locked merge and the reduce-add accumulation are order-dependent in "
"floating point. On SM90, `deterministic=True` makes the order fixed: "
"every lock carries an `[arrive_num, counter]` pair, the scheduler tracks "
"which slices have already visited each `(block, head)`, and a CTA waits "
"until all slices with a smaller index have committed before it merges. "
"This applies to the forward output, the backward `dQ`, and the backward "
"`dK`/`dV`. The SM100 kernel does not support deterministic mode with "
"ranges yet."
msgstr ""
"加锁合并与 reduce-add 累加在浮点意义下都依赖执行顺序。在 SM90 上，`deterministic=True` "
"会固定这一顺序：每把锁附带一对 `[arrive_num, counter]`，调度器记录每个 `(block, head)` 已经被哪些 "
"slice 访问过，CTA 在合并前会等待所有序号更小的 slice 提交完毕。该机制作用于前向输出、反向 `dQ` 以及反向 "
"`dK`/`dV`。SM100 kernel 目前在 ranges 模式下还不支持确定性。"

#: ../../source/blog/native_ffa.md:118
msgid "SM90 Implementation (Hopper)"
msgstr "SM90 实现（Hopper）"

#: ../../source/blog/native_ffa.md:120
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"The SM90 kernel is written in CUDA C++ on top of CUTLASS/CuTe and derives"
" from the `Flash-Attention 3` codebase "
"{cite}`shah2024flashattention3fastaccurateattention_native_ffa`. It is "
"the default backend."
msgstr ""
"SM90 kernel 使用 CUDA C++ 基于 CUTLASS/CuTe 编写，源自 `Flash-Attention 3` 代码库 "
"{cite}`shah2024flashattention3fastaccurateattention_native_ffa`，是当前的默认 "
"backend。"

#: ../../source/blog/native_ffa.md:122
msgid "Warp Specialization and Pipeline"
msgstr "Warp Specialization 与流水线"

#: ../../source/blog/native_ffa.md:124
msgid ""
"The kernel is a warp-specialized persistent kernel. Warpgroup 0 is the "
"producer, and one to three consumer warpgroups run WGMMA. Register "
"budgets are rebalanced with `setmaxnreg` and are chosen on the Python "
"side per configuration, for example `(producer, consumer) = (56, 256)` "
"with one MMA warpgroup, `(40, 232)` with two, and `(32, 160)` with three."
" In the TMA path, only one producer warp is needed and the other three "
"exit early. In the sparse scatter path, the whole producer warpgroup "
"issues `cp.async` loads."
msgstr ""
"这是一个 warp-specialized 的持久化 kernel。Warpgroup 0 是 producer，另有一到三个 consumer "
"warpgroup 执行 WGMMA。寄存器配额通过 `setmaxnreg` 重新分配，并由 Python 侧按配置选定，例如一个 MMA "
"warpgroup 时 `(producer, consumer) = (56, 256)`，两个时为 `(40, 232)`，三个时为 "
"`(32, 160)`。TMA 路径只需要一个 producer warp，另外三个 warp 会提前退出；稀疏 scatter 路径则由整个 "
"producer warpgroup 发起 `cp.async` 加载。"

#: ../../source/blog/native_ffa.md:126
msgid ""
"Q is loaded once per tile with TMA. K and V each have their own two-stage"
" pipeline, and the shared-memory buffer of `O` aliases the V buffer, "
"since the epilogue only needs it after the last PV GEMM. The PV GEMM uses"
" the register-sourced (RS) WGMMA variant, so `P` stays in registers after"
" softmax and never goes through shared memory."
msgstr ""
"Q 在每个 tile 中通过 TMA 加载一次。K 和 V 各有一条两级流水线，`O` 的 shared memory 缓冲与 V 缓冲复用，因为"
" epilogue 只在最后一次 PV GEMM 之后才需要它。PV GEMM 使用寄存器作为 A 操作数的（RS）WGMMA 变体，因此 "
"softmax 之后 `P` 一直留在寄存器中，不经过 shared memory。"

#: ../../source/blog/native_ffa.md:128
msgid "Forward Mainloop"
msgstr "前向主循环"

#: ../../source/blog/native_ffa.md:130
msgid "Two levels of overlap hide softmax latency behind Tensor Core work:"
msgstr "两层重叠把 softmax 延迟隐藏在 Tensor Core 计算之后："

#: ../../source/blog/native_ffa.md:132
msgid ""
"**Inter-warpgroup ping-pong**: with two consumer warpgroups, named "
"barriers make one warpgroup run its GEMMs while the other runs softmax."
msgstr ""
"**Warpgroup 间 ping-pong**：有两个 consumer warpgroup 时，通过 named barrier 让一个 "
"warpgroup 执行 GEMM 的同时另一个执行 softmax。"

#: ../../source/blog/native_ffa.md:133
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"**Intra-warpgroup overlap** (on by default): in the steady state, a "
"warpgroup issues `S_i = Q K_i^T`, then issues `O += P_{i-1} V_{i-1}`, "
"waits only for the first GEMM, runs mask and softmax on `S_i`, then waits"
" for the PV GEMM before rescaling `O`. For `head_dim > 128`, `O` is "
"rescaled before the PV GEMM is issued instead of after it completes."
msgstr ""
"**Warpgroup 内重叠**（默认开启）：稳态下，一个 warpgroup 先发起 `S_i = Q K_i^T`，再发起 `O += "
"P_{i-1} V_{i-1}`，只等待第一个 GEMM 完成就对 `S_i` 做 mask 与 softmax，之后再等待 PV GEMM "
"完成并重缩放 `O`。当 `head_dim > 128` 时，`O` 改为在发起 PV GEMM 之前重缩放，而不是在其完成之后。"

#: ../../source/blog/native_ffa.md:135
msgid ""
"Forward tile sizes are `(B_M, B_N) = (192, 128)` for `head_dim <= 64` and"
" `(128, 128)` for `head_dim <= 128`, and can be overridden with "
"`ref_block_size`."
msgstr ""
"前向 tile 尺寸在 `head_dim <= 64` 时为 `(B_M, B_N) = (192, 128)`，在 `head_dim <= "
"128` 时为 `(128, 128)`，可通过 `ref_block_size` 覆盖。"

#: ../../source/blog/native_ffa.md:137
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"For very short query ranges (for example the decode-like slices that "
"appear in sparse or inference workloads), `swap_ab=True` computes "
"{math}`S^\\mathrm{T} = K Q^\\mathrm{T}` and {math}`O^\\mathrm{T} = V "
"P^\\mathrm{T}` instead. The short query dimension then maps to the `N` "
"dimension of WGMMA, which can be as small as 8, rather than the `M` "
"dimension, which must be a multiple of 64. `ref_block_size` then takes "
"`(8 | 16 | 32 | 64, 64)`."
msgstr ""
"对于非常短的 query 区间（例如稀疏或推理负载中类似 decode 的 slice），`swap_ab=True` 会改为计算 "
"{math}`S^\\mathrm{T} = K Q^\\mathrm{T}` 与 {math}`O^\\mathrm{T} = V "
"P^\\mathrm{T}`。这样短的 query 维度被映射到 WGMMA 的 `N` 维（最小可到 8），而不是必须为 64 倍数的 `M` "
"维。此时 `ref_block_size` 取 `(8 | 16 | 32 | 64, 64)`。"

#: ../../source/blog/native_ffa.md:139
msgid "Backward Mainloop"
msgstr "反向主循环"

#: ../../source/blog/native_ffa.md:141
msgid "The backward kernel offers two loop orders:"
msgstr "反向 kernel 提供两种循环顺序："

#: ../../source/blog/native_ffa.md:143
msgid ""
"**LoopQ** (default): the outer loop is over K/V tiles, so `dK` and `dV` "
"accumulate in registers, and the inner loop is over Q/dO tiles. `dQ` is "
"written by a dedicated storer warp in the producer warpgroup with "
"`SM90_TMA_REDUCE_ADD` into a `float32` buffer."
msgstr ""
"**LoopQ**（默认）：外层循环遍历 K/V tile，`dK` 与 `dV` 在寄存器中累加；内层循环遍历 Q/dO tile。`dQ` 由"
" producer warpgroup 中专门的 storer warp 通过 `SM90_TMA_REDUCE_ADD` 写入 "
"`float32` 缓冲。"

#: ../../source/blog/native_ffa.md:144
msgid ""
"**LoopK** (`swap_bwd_qk_loop=True`): the outer loop is over Q/dO tiles, "
"so `dQ` accumulates in registers, and two storer warps reduce-add "
"`dK`/`dV`. This order suits shapes where few query tiles hit each key "
"tile, such as index-sparse attention with small key blocks, and it is the"
" order that supports `PackGQA` in the backward pass."
msgstr ""
"**LoopK**（`swap_bwd_qk_loop=True`）：外层循环遍历 Q/dO tile，`dQ` 在寄存器中累加，由两个 "
"storer warp 对 `dK`/`dV` 做 reduce-add。这种顺序适合每个 key tile 只被少量 query tile "
"命中的形状，例如 key block 较小的 index-sparse attention，同时它也是反向支持 `PackGQA` 的循环顺序。"

#: ../../source/blog/native_ffa.md:146
msgid ""
"Inner-dimension gradients can be written with a 2D TMA tile reduce, a 1D "
"bulk reduce (`cp.reduce.async.bulk.add.f32`, the default for sparse "
"workloads), or scalar `atomicAdd`. The operand swap of each backward GEMM"
" is chosen by `head_dim`: `S`/`dP` are swapped for `head_dim <= 128`, "
"`dK`/`dV` for `head_dim > 128`, and `dQ` for `head_dim > 64`."
msgstr ""
"内层维度的梯度可以用 2D TMA tile reduce、1D bulk "
"reduce（`cp.reduce.async.bulk.add.f32`，稀疏负载的默认方式）或标量 `atomicAdd` 写出。每个反向 "
"GEMM 是否交换操作数由 `head_dim` 决定：`head_dim <= 128` 时交换 `S`/`dP`，`head_dim > "
"128` 时交换 `dK`/`dV`，`head_dim > 64` 时交换 `dQ`。"

#: ../../source/blog/native_ffa.md:148
msgid "GQA"
msgstr "GQA"

#: ../../source/blog/native_ffa.md:150
msgid ""
"Without packing, each query head is a separate tile and is mapped to its "
"KV head. With `pack_gqa=True`, the `G = num_heads_q / num_heads_kv` query"
" heads that share a KV head are folded into the `M` dimension through a "
"hierarchical TMA layout `((G, seqlen), head_dim, num_heads_kv)`, so one "
"K/V tile load serves `G` heads. `cat_gqa` is an alternative layout for "
"the backward pass that is mutually exclusive with `pack_gqa`."
msgstr ""
"不做 pack 时，每个 query head 是独立的 tile，并映射到其对应的 KV head。设置 `pack_gqa=True` "
"后，共享同一个 KV head 的 `G = num_heads_q / num_heads_kv` 个 query head 通过层次化 TMA"
" 布局 `((G, seqlen), head_dim, num_heads_kv)` 折叠进 `M` 维，一次 K/V tile 加载即可服务 "
"`G` 个 head。`cat_gqa` 是反向的另一种布局，与 `pack_gqa` 互斥。"

#: ../../source/blog/native_ffa.md:96 ../../source/blog/native_ffa.md:152
#: ../../source/blog/native_ffa.md:222
msgid "Compilation"
msgstr "编译"

#: ../../source/blog/native_ffa.md:154
msgid ""
"Each distinct configuration is rendered from a Jinja template into a "
"single-variant `.cu` file, compiled with `nvcc` through Ninja, and cached"
" on disk under a URI that encodes every specialization (direction, head "
"dim, dtypes, softcap, reduction mode, deterministic, range merge, swap "
"AB, GQA mode, sparse mode, tile size, and so on). Common configurations "
"are pre-built into the wheel with the same machinery. See the [JIT "
"compilation](./jit_compile.md) post for details."
msgstr ""
"每种不同的配置都会由 Jinja 模板渲染成一个只含单一变体的 `.cu` 文件，经 Ninja 调用 `nvcc` 编译，并以 URI "
"为键缓存到磁盘；URI 编码了全部特化维度（方向、head dim、dtype、softcap、归约模式、确定性、range merge、swap"
" AB、GQA 模式、稀疏模式、tile 尺寸等）。常用配置会用同一套机制预编译进 wheel。详见 [JIT "
"编译](./jit_compile.md) 一文。"

#: ../../source/blog/native_ffa.md:156 ../../source/blog/native_ffa.md:226
msgid "Constraints"
msgstr "约束"

#: ../../source/blog/native_ffa.md:158
msgid ""
"The SM90 path targets `sm_90a` only, computes in `float16` or `bfloat16`,"
" and accepts `head_dim <= 128` (rounded up to 64 or 128). `O` can be "
"written as `float16`, `bfloat16`, or `float32`, and so can `dQ`, `dK`, "
"and `dV`. The build requires CUDA 13 by default, because building with "
"CUDA 12 can cause a significant performance drop. Set "
"`MAGI_ATTENTION_ALLOW_BUILD_WITH_CUDA12=1` to build with CUDA 12 anyway."
msgstr ""
"SM90 路径只面向 `sm_90a`，计算精度为 `float16` 或 `bfloat16`，支持 `head_dim <= "
"128`（向上取整为 64 或 128）。`O` 可以输出为 `float16`、`bfloat16` 或 "
"`float32`，`dQ`、`dK`、`dV` 同理。默认要求使用 CUDA 13 构建，因为用 CUDA 12 "
"构建可能导致明显的性能下降；如仍需使用 CUDA 12，可设置 "
"`MAGI_ATTENTION_ALLOW_BUILD_WITH_CUDA12=1`。"

#: ../../source/blog/native_ffa.md:161
msgid "SM100 Implementation (Blackwell)"
msgstr "SM100 实现（Blackwell）"

#: ../../source/blog/native_ffa.md:163
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"The SM100 kernel is written in CuTe DSL {cite}`cutlass-pythonDSL-"
"overview_native_ffa`. The codebase started from the `Flash-Attention 4` "
"CuTe module {cite}`dao2025flashattention_cute_native_ffa` and was rebuilt"
" as native `FFA`: the kernels read the `[R, 2]` range tensors directly "
"instead of `cu_seqlens`, accept overlapping query and key ranges, read a "
"per-slice mask type at runtime, and implement the same reduction regimes "
"as the SM90 kernel. This is different from `FFA_FA4`, which translates "
"slices into per-row `HSTU Function` intervals and block-sparse metadata "
"before calling a forked `FA4` kernel."
msgstr ""
"SM100 kernel 使用 CuTe DSL {cite}`cutlass-pythonDSL-overview_native_ffa` "
"编写。代码库起始于 `Flash-Attention 4` 的 CuTe 模块 "
"{cite}`dao2025flashattention_cute_native_ffa`，并被重构为原生 `FFA`：kernel 直接读取 "
"`[R, 2]` 的区间张量而非 `cu_seqlens`，支持 query 与 key 区间重叠，在运行时读取每个 slice 的 mask "
"类型，并实现了与 SM90 kernel 相同的归约模式。这与 `FFA_FA4` 不同，后者会先把 slice 转换为逐行的 `HSTU "
"Function` 区间与 block-sparse 元数据，再调用 fork 出来的 `FA4` kernel。"

#: ../../source/blog/native_ffa.md:165
msgid "Forward Kernel"
msgstr "前向 Kernel"

#: ../../source/blog/native_ffa.md:167
msgid "The forward kernel uses 16 warps with fixed roles:"
msgstr "前向 kernel 使用 16 个 warp，角色固定："

#: ../../source/blog/native_ffa.md:96
msgid "Warps"
msgstr "Warp"

#: ../../source/blog/native_ffa.md:96
msgid "Role"
msgstr "角色"

#: ../../source/blog/native_ffa.md:96
msgid "0-3"
msgstr "0-3"

#: ../../source/blog/native_ffa.md:96
msgid "`softmax0`: softmax for the first Q tile"
msgstr "`softmax0`：第一个 Q tile 的 softmax"

#: ../../source/blog/native_ffa.md:96
msgid "4-7"
msgstr "4-7"

#: ../../source/blog/native_ffa.md:96
msgid "`softmax1`: softmax for the second Q tile"
msgstr "`softmax1`：第二个 Q tile 的 softmax"

#: ../../source/blog/native_ffa.md:96
msgid "8-11"
msgstr "8-11"

#: ../../source/blog/native_ffa.md:96
msgid "`correction`: `O` rescaling, and the epilogue for ranges"
msgstr "`correction`：重缩放 `O`，并负责 ranges 模式下的 epilogue"

#: ../../source/blog/native_ffa.md:96
msgid "12"
msgstr "12"

#: ../../source/blog/native_ffa.md:96
msgid "`MMA`: issues all `tcgen05.mma` instructions"
msgstr "`MMA`：发起所有 `tcgen05.mma` 指令"

#: ../../source/blog/native_ffa.md:96
msgid "13"
msgstr "13"

#: ../../source/blog/native_ffa.md:96
msgid "`epilogue` (dense path)"
msgstr "`epilogue`（dense 路径）"

#: ../../source/blog/native_ffa.md:96
msgid "14"
msgstr "14"

#: ../../source/blog/native_ffa.md:96
msgid "`load`: TMA loads of Q, K, V"
msgstr "`load`：通过 TMA 加载 Q、K、V"

#: ../../source/blog/native_ffa.md:96
msgid "15"
msgstr "15"

#: ../../source/blog/native_ffa.md:96
msgid "spare, or the scheduler warp in persistent mode"
msgstr "空闲，持久化模式下作为调度 warp"

#: ../../source/blog/native_ffa.md:179
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Each CTA processes two 128-row Q tiles that share every K/V tile "
"(`q_stage = 2`), and the two softmax warpgroups alternate between them. A"
" single thread of the MMA warp issues every GEMM. It first computes `S_0 "
"= Q_0 K_0^T` and `S_1 = Q_1 K_0^T`, and then, in each iteration, `O += "
"P_{i-1} V_{i-1}` followed by `S = Q K_i^T` for each Q tile. The GEMM "
"descriptors are pre-built in registers, so advancing a pipeline stage "
"costs one integer add. To start the PV GEMM earlier, softmax signals it "
"after the first three quarters of `P` are written, and a second barrier "
"covers the last quarter."
msgstr ""
"每个 CTA 处理两个 128 行的 Q tile，它们共享每一个 K/V tile（`q_stage = 2`），两个 softmax "
"warpgroup 在二者之间交替。MMA warp 中的单个线程发起所有 GEMM：先计算 `S_0 = Q_0 K_0^T` 和 `S_1 ="
" Q_1 K_0^T`，之后每轮迭代对每个 Q tile 先算 `O += P_{i-1} V_{i-1}`，再算 `S = Q "
"K_i^T`。GEMM descriptor 预先构造在寄存器中，推进一级流水只需一次整数加法。为了让 PV GEMM 更早启动，softmax "
"在写完前四分之三的 `P` 后就发出信号，剩余四分之一由另一个 barrier 同步。"

#: ../../source/blog/native_ffa.md:181
msgid ""
"All accumulators live in Tensor Memory (TMEM). The 512 columns are used "
"exactly:"
msgstr "所有累加器都位于 Tensor Memory（TMEM）中，512 列恰好用满："

#: ../../source/blog/native_ffa.md:96
msgid "TMEM columns"
msgstr "TMEM 列"

#: ../../source/blog/native_ffa.md:96
msgid "Content"
msgstr "内容"

#: ../../source/blog/native_ffa.md:96
msgid "`[0, 128)`"
msgstr "`[0, 128)`"

#: ../../source/blog/native_ffa.md:96
msgid "`S_0`, with `P_0` (bf16) aliased at `[64, 192)`"
msgstr "`S_0`，`P_0`（bf16）复用 `[64, 192)`"

#: ../../source/blog/native_ffa.md:96
msgid "`[128, 256)`"
msgstr "`[128, 256)`"

#: ../../source/blog/native_ffa.md:96
msgid "`S_1`, with `P_1` aliased at the same offset"
msgstr "`S_1`，`P_1` 以相同偏移复用"

#: ../../source/blog/native_ffa.md:96
msgid "`[256, 256 + d_v)`"
msgstr "`[256, 256 + d_v)`"

#: ../../source/blog/native_ffa.md:96
msgid "`O_0`"
msgstr "`O_0`"

#: ../../source/blog/native_ffa.md:96
msgid "`[256 + d_v, 256 + 2 d_v)`"
msgstr "`[256 + d_v, 256 + 2 d_v)`"

#: ../../source/blog/native_ffa.md:96
msgid "`O_1`"
msgstr "`O_1`"

#: ../../source/blog/native_ffa.md:190
msgid ""
"Row max and row sum reuse the `S` columns once softmax has consumed them."
" The PV GEMM reads `P` from TMEM as its A operand, so `P` never goes "
"through shared memory."
msgstr ""
"softmax 消费完 `S` 后，row max 与 row sum 复用 `S` 所在的列。PV GEMM 直接从 TMEM 读取 `P` "
"作为 A 操作数，因此 `P` 不经过 shared memory。"

#: ../../source/blog/native_ffa.md:192
msgid "Softmax uses two tricks inherited from `FA4`:"
msgstr "softmax 沿用了 `FA4` 的两个技巧："

#: ../../source/blog/native_ffa.md:194
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"**Conditional rescaling**: the running max is only updated when the new "
"max exceeds the old one by more than a threshold (8 in the "
"{math}`\\log_2` domain for 16-bit inputs). Otherwise, the stale max is "
"kept and the rescale factor is exactly 1. The correction warpgroup checks"
" this with a warp ballot and skips rescaling `O` in TMEM when no row "
"needs it."
msgstr ""
"**条件重缩放**：只有当新的最大值比旧值高出一个阈值（16-bit 输入时在 {math}`\\log_2` 域为 8）时才更新 running"
" max，否则沿用旧的最大值，重缩放因子恰好为 1。correction warpgroup 用 warp ballot "
"判断这一点，在没有任何行需要时跳过对 TMEM 中 `O` 的重缩放。"

#: ../../source/blog/native_ffa.md:195
msgid ""
"**Software `exp2`**: a fraction of the exponentials are computed with a "
"polynomial on the FMA pipes instead of the MUFU unit, to balance the two "
"pipes. The fraction is tuned per `(2-CTA, causal, head_dim, arch)`. On "
"SM103 (B300), whose special function units are fast enough on their own, "
"the emulation is disabled."
msgstr ""
"**软件 `exp2`**：一部分指数运算改为在 FMA 流水线上用多项式计算，而不是走 MUFU 单元，以平衡两条流水线的负载。该比例按 "
"`(2-CTA, causal, head_dim, arch)` 调优。SM103（B300）的特殊函数单元本身已经足够快，因此不启用该模拟。"

#: ../../source/blog/native_ffa.md:197
msgid ""
"For ranges, the correction warpgroup also runs the epilogue, including "
"the locked LSE-weighted merge described above. It takes the lock of the "
"lower physical block with a blocking spin and the lock of the upper block"
" with a try-lock. If the try-lock fails, it releases the lower lock and "
"retries, so a CTA never waits while holding a lock."
msgstr ""
"在 ranges 模式下，correction warpgroup 还负责 epilogue，包括前文所述的加锁 LSE 加权合并。它对较低的物理"
" block 以阻塞自旋方式加锁，对较高的 block 则使用 try-lock；try-lock 失败时先释放低块的锁再重试，从而保证 CTA "
"不会在持锁的同时等待。"

#: ../../source/blog/native_ffa.md:199
msgid ""
"Non-causal configurations with `head_dim` 128 or 192 can use 2-CTA MMA "
"(`cta_group::2`, cluster `(2, 1)`), where an MMA tile spans 256 query "
"rows across a CTA pair. Kernels that read per-slice mask types at runtime"
" currently use 1-CTA instructions. The number of K/V pipeline stages is "
"derived from the shared-memory budget, and when `O` is accumulated in "
"`float32` it can reuse K/V slots that have already been consumed, which "
"keeps two Q tiles resident."
msgstr ""
"`head_dim` 为 128 或 192 的非 causal 配置可以使用 2-CTA MMA（`cta_group::2`，cluster "
"为 `(2, 1)`），此时一个 MMA tile 横跨一对 CTA 覆盖 256 行 query。运行时读取逐 slice mask 类型的 "
"kernel 目前使用 1-CTA 指令。K/V 流水级数由 shared memory 预算推导得出；当 `O` 以 `float32` "
"累加时，可以复用已经消费完的 K/V slot，从而保持两个 Q tile 常驻。"

