#: ../../source/blog/native_ffa.md:214
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"The loop order is K-outer, which corresponds to `LoopQ` on SM90. For each"
" K/V tile, the kernel walks the visible Q tiles and issues five GEMMs: "
"{math}`S^\\mathrm{T} = K Q^\\mathrm{T}`, {math}`dP^\\mathrm{T} = V\\, "
"dO^\\mathrm{T}`, {math}`dV \\mathrel{+}= P^\\mathrm{T} dO`, {math}`dK "
"\\mathrel{+}= dS^\\mathrm{T} Q`, and {math}`dQ = dS\\, K`. `S`, `dP`, "
"`dV`, `dK`, and `dQ` all live in TMEM. `P` and `dS` alias the left halves"
" of `S` and `dP`. `dQ` aliases `dP` in 1-CTA mode and the right half of "
"`S` in 2-CTA mode, and in both cases the next producer GEMM waits until "
"the reduce warpgroup has drained the previous `dQ`."
msgstr ""
"循环顺序为 K-outer，对应 SM90 上的 `LoopQ`。对每个 K/V tile，kernel 遍历可见的 Q tile 并发起五个 "
"GEMM：{math}`S^\\mathrm{T} = K Q^\\mathrm{T}`、{math}`dP^\\mathrm{T} = V\\,"
" dO^\\mathrm{T}`、{math}`dV \\mathrel{+}= P^\\mathrm{T} dO`、{math}`dK "
"\\mathrel{+}= dS^\\mathrm{T} Q` 以及 {math}`dQ = dS\\, "
"K`。`S`、`dP`、`dV`、`dK`、`dQ` 全部位于 TMEM 中，`P` 与 `dS` 分别复用 `S` 与 `dP` "
"的左半部分。`dQ` 在 1-CTA 模式下与 `dP` 复用，在 2-CTA 模式下复用 `S` 的右半部分；两种情况下，下一个产生该区域的 "
"GEMM 都要等 reduce warpgroup 取走上一份 `dQ` 之后才能开始。"

#: ../../source/blog/native_ffa.md:216
msgid ""
"`dQ` goes from TMEM to registers, then to shared memory, and is reduce-"
"added to a token-major `float32` buffer with TMA bulk reduce. The "
"unaligned start of a query range is used directly as the TMA coordinate. "
"A postprocess kernel applies `softmax_scale` and casts the result. "
"`dK`/`dV` are stored directly with TMA for MHA with disjoint key ranges. "
"For GQA, or when slices share key rows, they are reduce-added to "
"`float32` buffers and cast afterwards. `head_dim >= 128` can use 2-CTA "
"MMA, and `head_dim = 192` requires it."
msgstr ""
"`dQ` 从 TMEM 读到寄存器，再写入 shared memory，然后通过 TMA bulk reduce 累加到按 token "
"行主序排布的 `float32` 缓冲中，未对齐的 query 区间起点直接作为 TMA 坐标使用。之后由 postprocess kernel "
"乘以 `softmax_scale` 并转换 dtype。对于 key 区间不相交的 MHA，`dK`/`dV` 通过 TMA 直接写回；对于 "
"GQA 或多个 slice 共享 key 行的情况，它们先 reduce-add 到 `float32` 缓冲，之后再转换 "
"dtype。`head_dim >= 128` 时可以使用 2-CTA MMA，`head_dim = 192` 时必须使用。"

#: ../../source/blog/native_ffa.md:96 ../../source/blog/native_ffa.md:218
msgid "Scheduling"
msgstr "调度"

#: ../../source/blog/native_ffa.md:220
msgid ""
"By default, the SM100 forward kernel launches a static grid. Its size is "
"an upper bound on the number of tiles, computed from `total_q + R * (B_M "
"- 1)`, and each CTA decodes its tile from a prefix sum over slice "
"lengths. When query ranges overlap and the kernel is not persistent, the "
"grid becomes `(ceil(max_seqlen_q / B_M), heads, R)` so that each slice "
"gets a fixed quota of CTAs. When `sm_margin > 0`, both passes switch to a"
" dynamic persistent schedule. The grid is capped at `num_SMs - sm_margin`"
" (rounded to the cluster size), and a scheduler warp in the leader CTA "
"fetches tiles from a global atomic counter and broadcasts the tile index "
"to every CTA of the cluster."
msgstr ""
"默认情况下，SM100 前向 kernel 启动一个静态网格，其大小是 tile 数的上界，由 `total_q + R * (B_M - 1)`"
" 计算得出，每个 CTA 通过 slice 长度的前缀和解码出自己的 tile。当 query 区间存在重叠且 kernel 非持久化时，网格改为"
" `(ceil(max_seqlen_q / B_M), heads, R)`，为每个 slice 分配固定配额的 CTA。当 "
"`sm_margin > 0` 时，前向与反向都会切换为动态持久化调度：网格上限为 `num_SMs - sm_margin`（按 cluster"
" 大小取整），由 leader CTA 中的调度 warp 从全局原子计数器领取 tile，并把 tile 索引广播给 cluster 内的所有 "
"CTA。"

#: ../../source/blog/native_ffa.md:224
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Kernels are compiled with `cute.compile` and launched through TVM FFI "
"{cite}`cutlass-pythonDSL-cute-compile-with-tvm-ffi_native_ffa`, which "
"removes most per-call host overhead. Compiled kernels are cached in "
"memory by a compile key and can also be persisted to disk "
"(`MAGI_ATTENTION_FFA_CUTEDSL_CACHE_ENABLED`, "
"`MAGI_ATTENTION_FFA_CUTEDSL_CACHE_DIR`). The disk cache is keyed by a "
"fingerprint of the kernel sources, the `nvidia-cutlass-dsl`, `quack-"
"kernels`, and TVM FFI versions, and the CUDA version. The supported "
"`nvidia-cutlass-dsl` / `quack-kernels` pairs are listed in the "
"[Installation Guide](../user_guide/install.md)."
msgstr ""
"kernel 通过 `cute.compile` 编译，并经由 TVM FFI {cite}`cutlass-pythonDSL-cute-"
"compile-with-tvm-ffi_native_ffa` 启动，从而去掉了大部分每次调用的 host 开销。编译好的 kernel 按 "
"compile key "
"缓存在内存中，也可以持久化到磁盘（`MAGI_ATTENTION_FFA_CUTEDSL_CACHE_ENABLED`、`MAGI_ATTENTION_FFA_CUTEDSL_CACHE_DIR`）。磁盘缓存的键是一个指纹，由"
" kernel 源码、`nvidia-cutlass-dsl`、`quack-kernels` 与 TVM FFI 的版本以及 CUDA "
"版本共同决定。受支持的 `nvidia-cutlass-dsl` / `quack-kernels` 版本组合见 "
"[安装指南](../user_guide/install.md)。"

#: ../../source/blog/native_ffa.md:228
msgid ""
"The SM100 backend is still work in progress. It computes in `float16` or "
"`bfloat16` and supports `head_dim <= 128` and `(head_dim, head_dim_v) = "
"(192, 128)`. `O`, `dQ`, `dK`, and `dV` can be written as `float32`, "
"`float16`, or `bfloat16`. Deterministic mode is not supported with "
"ranges, `softcap` is not available on the per-slice-mask path, and "
"`PackGQA` is only used by the forward pass when the output is direct-"
"stored."
msgstr ""
"SM100 backend 仍在开发中。它的计算精度为 `float16` 或 `bfloat16`，支持 `head_dim <= 128` "
"以及 `(head_dim, head_dim_v) = (192, 128)`。`O`、`dQ`、`dK`、`dV` 可以输出为 "
"`float32`、`float16` 或 `bfloat16`。ranges 模式下不支持确定性，逐 slice mask 路径不支持 "
"`softcap`，且 `PackGQA` 仅在前向直接写回输出时使用。"

