#: ../../source/blog/native_ffa.md:326
msgid ""
"`max_seqlen_q` and `max_seqlen_k` are hard upper bounds for the SM100 "
"kernel: launch bounds are sized from them, so an underestimate silently "
"drops work. Omit them to fall back to the safe `total_q` / `total_k` "
"bounds."
msgstr ""
"对 SM100 kernel 而言，`max_seqlen_q` 与 `max_seqlen_k` 是硬性上界：launch "
"范围按它们确定，传小了会静默丢失部分计算。不传时会回退到安全的 `total_q` / `total_k` 上界。"

#: ../../source/blog/native_ffa.md:329
msgid ""
"For distributed attention, `calc_attn` picks the kernel through "
"`MAGI_ATTENTION_KERNEL_BACKEND`: `ffa` (default) on Hopper, or `cutedsl` "
"on Blackwell. The reduction mode, `sm_margin`, and range merge are "
"configured by `MagiAttention` from the attn solver output and the "
"[environment variables](../user_guide/env_variables.md), so `calc_attn` "
"users do not pass them by hand."
msgstr ""
"在分布式注意力中，`calc_attn` 通过 `MAGI_ATTENTION_KERNEL_BACKEND` 选择 kernel：Hopper "
"上用 `ffa`（默认），Blackwell 上用 `cutedsl`。归约模式、`sm_margin` 以及 range merge 都由 "
"`MagiAttention` 根据 attn solver 的输出和 "
"[环境变量](../user_guide/env_variables.md) 自动配置，`calc_attn` 的使用者无需手动传入。"

